          "error": {
            "code": 404,
            "message": "Document \"projects/demo-conformance/databases/(default)/documents/conf_values/definitely-missing\" not found.",
            "status": "NOT_FOUND"
          }
        },
        "status": 404
      },
      "documents": "conformance/FIRESTORE-PRODUCTION-MATRIX.md; README.md, \"Gap from the official Firebase Emulator Suite\"",
      "reason": "Production answers a missing document with `Document \"projects/.../documents/...\" not found.` (recorded 2026-09-07); the official emulator says `Document (projects/.../documents/...) not found.`. fireemu follows production (567565bdd)."
